AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ArcEngine --> CompatibleARCclient <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Sends one result or bounded watch responses with matching ID/version"
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.OwnerCommandFacade --> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ComposemanagementUI <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Returns protected command result or explicit failure"
