AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.SessionCommandFacade --> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ArcClientAdapter <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Forwards admitted explicit target/session command"
